<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-BELGIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Belgian first</p>
<p>division soccer matches on Saturday</p>
<p> Lommel	   2	 Ghent	   2</p>
<p> Mouscron	 2	 Antwerp	 2</p>
<p> Anderlecht     4	 Cercle Brugge 0</p>
<p> Ekeren	   0	 Genk	    1</p>
<p> Charleroi	1	 Sint Truiden  1</p>
<p> Mechelen	 2	 Lierse	  2</p>
<p> Lokeren	  0	 Molenbeek     0</p>
